    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can choose creatures within 30 feet of you, including yourself, up to a number equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of one). Each has Half Cover for 1 minute or until you have the Incapacitated condition. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you expend a Psionic Energy Die (no action required) to restore it.</p>",
